who was awakened in 2026.

525
00:17:30,800 --> 00:17:31,840
I'm also one of the detectives
in this case.

526
00:17:32,560 --> 00:17:35,000
Didn't I die in Year 260 of Tui?

527
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:36,040
How did I wake up

528
00:17:36,040 --> 00:17:37,440
in such a strange place?

529
00:17:37,440 --> 00:17:38,560
(Completely bewildered)
Where am I?

530
00:17:38,560 --> 00:17:39,280
What is this place?

531
00:17:39,280 --> 00:17:41,640
And why is everyone saying things
I can't understand?

532
00:17:42,760 --> 00:17:44,680
After piecing everything together,

533
00:17:45,560 --> 00:17:48,720
I realized it was 2026,

534
00:17:48,720 --> 00:17:50,200
not year 260.

535
00:17:51,240 --> 00:17:53,360
I also found Curator Tui dead
in the gallery,

536
00:17:53,360 --> 00:17:54,720
wearing the Ghost Armor.

537
00:17:55,760 --> 00:17:57,600
What was going on?

538
00:17:58,520 --> 00:17:59,920
At the auction,

539
00:18:00,320 --> 00:18:01,280
every suspect

540
00:18:01,280 --> 00:18:03,500
was connected to one of the treasures.

541
00:18:03,500 --> 00:18:04,440
(Everyone's ties to the treasures)

542
00:18:04,440 --> 00:18:06,800
They also all had a history
with Curator Tui.

543
00:18:07,360 --> 00:18:08,680
After hearing their stories,

544
00:18:08,680 --> 00:18:10,680
I realized Jin, Ding, and He

545
00:18:10,680 --> 00:18:12,800
all had grudges against him.

546
00:18:12,800 --> 00:18:15,520
Ning also claimed
he was from Year 260 of Tui,

547
00:18:15,520 --> 00:18:17,000
just like us.

548
00:18:17,920 --> 00:18:20,160
He'd awakened before Yang and me.

549
00:18:20,160 --> 00:18:21,320
As the investigation continued,

550
00:18:21,320 --> 00:18:24,360
we learned Ding
and Jin's true identities.

551
00:18:24,720 --> 00:18:26,600
Ding was the leader
of The Touch Today Group,

552
00:18:27,440 --> 00:18:30,510
(Testimony confirms their identities)
while Jin was with the Eagle King group.

553
00:18:30,560 --> 00:18:31,880
Because Jin had been deceived,

554
00:18:31,880 --> 00:18:33,280
we were taken to R Corporation.

555
00:18:34,120 --> 00:18:35,240
There, we uncovered

556
00:18:35,240 --> 00:18:36,880
R Corporation's hidden conspiracy.

557
00:18:36,880 --> 00:18:37,600
A special drug...

558
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:39,200
They'd abducted countless villagers

559
00:18:39,640 --> 00:18:40,480
for one purpose.

560
00:18:40,480 --> 00:18:43,280
They wanted to conduct biological tests

561
00:18:43,280 --> 00:18:45,960
using the Qide Longdong formula
extracted from the three of us.

562
00:18:46,880 --> 00:18:47,600
We also discovered

563
00:18:47,600 --> 00:18:49,960
that Curator Tui was a member
of R Corporation.

564
00:18:49,960 --> 00:18:51,200
(Combining clues to reveal the truth
and killer's motive)

565
00:18:51,200 --> 00:18:52,960
After rescuing the villagers,

566
00:18:52,960 --> 00:18:54,160
we returned to the gallery.

567
00:18:54,920 --> 00:18:56,640
During the final discussion,

568
00:18:56,640 --> 00:18:57,800
Ning Waver confessed

569
00:18:57,800 --> 00:19:00,360
that he was actually
the modern-day Ning Bo.

570
00:19:00,360 --> 00:19:01,320
A modern man.

571
00:19:01,320 --> 00:19:04,840
Jin, Ning, and He are all part
of the Thousand-Faced Eagle King group.

572
00:19:05,640 --> 00:19:07,080
(Testimony confirms)
They shared the same mission

573
00:19:07,080 --> 00:19:09,080
(the shared mission)
to steal the three treasures.

574
00:19:09,080 --> 00:19:10,200
That ruled out Ding.

575
00:19:10,200 --> 00:19:11,000
He wouldn't know it.

576
00:19:11,000 --> 00:19:12,180
(Group-only message)
Because he wasn't part

577
00:19:12,180 --> 00:19:13,600
(clears Ding Tian)
of the Thousand-Faced Eagle King group.

578
00:19:13,600 --> 00:19:14,880
My reasoning was simple.

579
00:19:14,880 --> 00:19:15,680
Who was most likely

580
00:19:15,680 --> 00:19:18,400
to have discovered Curator Tui's plan?

581
00:19:18,400 --> 00:19:22,160
And who had a reason
to enter his office?

582
00:19:22,160 --> 00:19:24,420
(Using clues to narrow the suspects)
I mapped it out in circles.

583
00:19:24,440 --> 00:19:26,080
The first circle was group membership.

584
00:19:26,800 --> 00:19:27,640
That ruled out Ding.

585
00:19:28,320 --> 00:19:30,000
The second circle was timing.

586
00:19:30,920 --> 00:19:32,120
Who had time to commit the crime?

587
00:19:32,120 --> 00:19:33,960
Three of them received the same mission.

588
00:19:33,960 --> 00:19:35,480
During the final vote,

589
00:19:35,480 --> 00:19:37,120
I decided to think in reverse.

590
00:19:37,120 --> 00:19:39,560
Too many clues pointed straight at Ning.

591
00:19:40,320 --> 00:19:41,440
His two identities

592
00:19:41,440 --> 00:19:42,760
and his cleaning job

593
00:19:42,760 --> 00:19:44,600
(Too obvious to be Ning)
felt more like a setup to me.

594
00:19:44,680 --> 00:19:47,800
(Voting window: Hehe)
So, I chose Hehe, the gallery guard.

595
00:19:48,420 --> 00:19:50,660
(Yang Chaoyue player log archive)

596
00:19:50,700 --> 00:19:51,420
(Identity: Yang Glory)

597
00:19:51,420 --> 00:19:52,140
(Thousand-Faced Eagle King's Founder)

598
00:19:52,140 --> 00:19:52,940
(A changed world, time meaningless)

599
00:19:53,160 --> 00:19:54,360
I'm player Yang Chaoyue.

600
00:19:54,960 --> 00:19:56,960
In this case, I play Yang Glory,

601
00:19:56,960 --> 00:19:58,240
who was awakened in 2026.

602
00:19:58,720 --> 00:20:00,120
I'm also one of the detectives
in this case.

603
00:20:00,640 --> 00:20:02,640
I woke up in a strange place

604
00:20:03,160 --> 00:20:04,720
with no idea why I'd been locked up.

605
00:20:05,200 --> 00:20:06,640
- I pounded on the door in panic.
- Is anyone there?

606
00:20:07,080 --> 00:20:08,320
To my surprise,
Ke Stubborn was there too.

607
00:20:08,320 --> 00:20:10,280
Ke Stubborn, you're here too?

608
00:20:10,280 --> 00:20:11,080
That's strange.

609
00:20:11,080 --> 00:20:12,800
Didn't we already die?

610
00:20:12,800 --> 00:20:14,040
A few people heard us calling for help

611
00:20:14,040 --> 00:20:15,280
and came to rescue us.

612
00:20:16,280 --> 00:20:17,600
They were He Ha,

613
00:20:18,160 --> 00:20:18,920
Ding Pillar,

614
00:20:19,440 --> 00:20:20,240
Jin Thrifty,

615
00:20:20,640 --> 00:20:21,520
and Ning Waver.

616
00:20:22,400 --> 00:20:24,280
But they said
they were only role-playing.

617
00:20:24,280 --> 00:20:25,720
Just role-playing.

618
00:20:25,720 --> 00:20:27,840
And every one of them
had a two-character name.

619
00:20:28,640 --> 00:20:29,760
What was going on?

620
00:20:30,520 --> 00:20:33,360
They told me it was now 2026.

621
00:20:33,960 --> 00:20:35,000
Unbelievable.

622
00:20:35,440 --> 00:20:37,080
We heard a strange sound

623
00:20:37,080 --> 00:20:38,360
and left the secret room.

624
00:20:38,840 --> 00:20:40,520
Outside, we saw the Ghost Armor

625
00:20:40,520 --> 00:20:41,480
and a trail of blood.

626
00:20:42,360 --> 00:20:43,900
(Ancient knowledge confirmed)
It seemed the ghost soldier legend

627
00:20:43,900 --> 00:20:45,400
(the legend)
had survived into this era.

628
00:20:45,480 --> 00:20:46,320
We followed the blood

629
00:20:46,320 --> 00:20:48,920
and found Curator Tui's body
in the gallery.

630
00:20:49,920 --> 00:20:51,560
After watching the footage,

631
00:20:51,560 --> 00:20:52,200
we concluded

632
00:20:52,200 --> 00:20:53,920
(Reconstructing the crime)
that this might be a locked-room murder.

633
00:20:55,440 --> 00:20:56,400
(Invitation)
The invitation led us

634
00:20:56,400 --> 00:20:58,240
to a secret auction.

635
00:20:59,320 --> 00:21:00,560
The auctioneer claimed

636
00:21:00,560 --> 00:21:02,520
that my kite was a Tui family heirloom.

637
00:21:03,480 --> 00:21:04,560
(Her heirloom under another name)
I was confused.

638
00:21:04,560 --> 00:21:06,660
(Harboring her doubts)
Wasn't that mine?

639
00:21:06,760 --> 00:21:08,640
We found more clues there

640
00:21:09,560 --> 00:21:11,800
and uncovered motives
for all four suspects.

641
00:21:12,680 --> 00:21:14,120
The pot

642
00:21:14,120 --> 00:21:16,680
(Evidence points to the third treasure)
made me suspect Ning was the third.

643
00:21:16,680 --> 00:21:18,200
He admitted it.

644
00:21:19,000 --> 00:21:21,080
That brought
all three treasures together.

645
00:21:21,800 --> 00:21:23,880
But Ding Tian and his men abducted us.

646
00:21:24,720 --> 00:21:25,240
On the way,

647
00:21:25,240 --> 00:21:27,760
one of them exchanged
the secret code with Jin Da

648
00:21:28,520 --> 00:21:29,520
and claimed to be one of us.

649
00:21:30,760 --> 00:21:32,600
We were taken somewhere unfamiliar.

650
00:21:33,280 --> 00:21:35,320
It turned out R Corporation
had intercepted us

651
00:21:35,680 --> 00:21:36,760
and taken us captive.

652
00:21:37,560 --> 00:21:38,620
(Thousand-Faced Eagle King)
Jin Da said

653
00:21:38,620 --> 00:21:40,360
she had joined
the Thousand-Faced Eagle King group.

654
00:21:41,040 --> 00:21:42,600
So my wish from long ago,

655
00:21:42,600 --> 00:21:44,840
that my legacy would live on,

656
00:21:44,840 --> 00:21:45,680
had really come true.

657
00:21:45,680 --> 00:21:46,680
All to save the people.

658
00:21:46,680 --> 00:21:48,280
We found the lab

659
00:21:48,280 --> 00:21:50,400
and learned that R Corporation wanted
the three of us

660
00:21:50,400 --> 00:21:53,680
to extract Qide Longdong serum
for biological testing.

661
00:21:53,680 --> 00:21:54,680
(Evidence reveals R Corporation's goal)

662
00:21:54,680 --> 00:21:56,000
After returning to the gallery,

663
00:21:56,000 --> 00:21:57,320
we discovered that Curator Tui's

664
00:21:57,320 --> 00:21:59,760
encrypted hard drive
had been stolen.

665
00:21:59,780 --> 00:22:01,000
(Reconstructing the clues
to learn the victim's murder plan)

666
00:22:01,000 --> 00:22:02,040
He knew who was responsible

667
00:22:02,520 --> 00:22:03,880
and planned to kill them.

668
00:22:04,600 --> 00:22:06,040
But the killer found out

669
00:22:06,040 --> 00:22:07,640
(Reconstructing the full sequence)
and turned the plan against him.

670
00:22:07,640 --> 00:22:08,400
(to solving the murder)

671
00:22:08,400 --> 00:22:10,200
Then, Ning's identity changed yet again.

672
00:22:10,200 --> 00:22:11,360
A modern man.

673
00:22:11,360 --> 00:22:13,840
I believed Ning had the easiest access

674
00:22:13,840 --> 00:22:15,360
to Curator Tui's office

675
00:22:15,360 --> 00:22:16,560
and the best excuse to be there.

676
00:22:16,890 --> 00:22:17,920
(Identifying who had the easiest access)
After all, he was the cleaner.

677
00:22:17,920 --> 00:22:18,520
(Ning becomes the prime suspect)

678
00:22:18,520 --> 00:22:20,920
Jin's job as an artifact restorer
was suspicious too.

679
00:22:20,920 --> 00:22:23,240
She had access to every artifact
in the gallery

680
00:22:23,240 --> 00:22:24,460
(Jin Da's job reveals)
and may have known

681
00:22:24,460 --> 00:22:25,540
(a possible motive)
the artifacts were fake.

682
00:22:25,560 --> 00:22:27,280
That would give her reason
to investigate Curator Tui.

683
00:22:27,840 --> 00:22:29,880
But there were too many clues pointing
at Ning.

684
00:22:29,880 --> 00:22:31,520
I think it should be the cleaner.

685
00:22:31,520 --> 00:22:33,880
He kept agreeing with me
and accusing Ning,

686
00:22:34,360 --> 00:22:35,880
(Watching reactions, doubting motives)
which made him look even guiltier.

687
00:22:35,920 --> 00:22:36,760
In the end,

688
00:22:36,760 --> 00:22:38,160
I voted for Hehe.

689
00:22:38,160 --> 00:22:39,540
(Voting window: Hehe)

690
00:22:39,540 --> 00:23:21,500
=The Truth (Season 4)=
(Viewing Calendar)

691
00:23:38,270 --> 00:23:42,270
♪Come now, players all,
let the game of reason start♪

692
00:23:42,270 --> 00:23:46,710
♪Unlock each hidden trial,
let courage spark the dark♪

693
00:23:48,710 --> 00:23:52,870
♪Night falls slow, shadows grow,
the sleuth is lost inside the maze♪

694
00:23:52,870 --> 00:23:57,110
♪Figures pass, lanterns sparse,
dark currents drift without a trace♪

695
00:23:57,110 --> 00:24:00,870
♪Wind picks up, footsteps rush,
cold laughter swallowed by the dark♪

696
00:24:00,870 --> 00:24:04,990
♪Truth concealed, the night
stands still, and nothing leaves a mark♪

697
00:24:05,150 --> 00:24:09,270
♪An unsigned letter, coded words,
the solvers gather one by one♪

698
00:24:09,270 --> 00:24:13,390
♪A broken game, illusion reigns,
who's hiding what they've done?♪

699
00:24:13,390 --> 00:24:17,030
♪Hushed voices, nerves on edge,
wrapped in smoke and mirrors still♪

700
00:24:17,030 --> 00:24:19,150
♪The next second, deeper riddles,
or the answer to the kill♪

701
00:24:19,150 --> 00:24:23,110
♪Every piece of truth
has finally come to light♪

702
00:24:23,350 --> 00:24:27,270
♪Unlock the mystery, turn the question,
let's begin tonight♪

703
00:24:27,470 --> 00:24:31,630
♪Side by side, no holding back,
follow every clue to find the truth♪

704
00:24:31,630 --> 00:24:35,190
♪The story blurs like flowers in fog,
let's begin tonight♪

705
00:24:35,470 --> 00:24:40,110
♪Search for the vanished cipher,
trace the proof, and face the sleuth♪
